metadata/text = "Playable forest artwork:\nLPC outdoor tiles — Lanea Zimmerman (Sharm)\nhttps://github.com/OpenGameArt/LiberatedPixelCup\nCreative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0\nhttps://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/\nOriginal source PNGs are unchanged. Atlas composition and terrain arrangements retain CC BY-SA 3.0.\n\nLPC Revised plants, flowers, mushrooms — Eliza Wyatt (DeathsDarling), Lanea Zimmerman (Sharm), Hyptosis, BlueCarrot16, Demetrius\nhttps://github.com/ElizaWy/LPC\nOGA-BY 3.0: https://opengameart.org/content/oga-by-30-faq\nOriginal PNGs are unchanged. Per-sheet credits and source links: assets/environment_human/lpc_revised/Terrain-Credits.txt\n\nSave star — Kenney (Game icon pack), CC0\nhttps://kenney.nl/assets/game-icons\n\nFull notices, original licenses and source hashes: assets/environment_human/ and assets/save_star_human/."
